Acceptance criteria:
Skill installation does not activate speech or devices or restart sessions.
Commands correspond to actual code; no invented CLI flags/autostart/voice policy.
Creation-time choices versus disabled live settings are accurate. Performance
measurements retain limits. Distinct-hue policy covers every feature/model,
original defaults, simultaneous agents, current confirmation and bounded failure.
Color choices remain free in the app; no finite forced palette or visual guarantee.
No credentials, capabilities, private conversation or sibling source in output.

